{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41637","headline":"宿岛径夷山舍 · 陈陶","name":"宿岛径夷山舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百里遵鸟径，蓬征信邅回。\n暝依渔樵宿，似过黄金台。\n缺啮心未理，寥寥夜猨哀。\n山深石牀冷，海近腥气来。\n主人意不浅，屡献流霞杯。\n对月抚长剑，愁襟纷莫开。\n九衢平如水，胡爲涉崔崽。\n一饭未遑饱，鹏图信悠哉。\n山涛谑细君，吾岂厌蓬莱。\n明发又驱马，客思一裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}